1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,123
Cyber safety.

2
00:00:01,123 --> 00:00:03,541
Four things every student must know.

3
00:00:04,141 --> 00:00:04,566
First,

4
00:00:04,566 --> 00:00:06,335
digital arrest is a scam.

5
00:00:06,335 --> 00:00:09,379
No police officer or agency arrests anyone,

6
00:00:09,379 --> 00:00:10,582
or demands money,

7
00:00:10,582 --> 00:00:12,493
over a phone or video call.

8
00:00:13,093 --> 00:00:13,457
Next,

9
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:14,986
never share your OTP,

10
00:00:14,986 --> 00:00:16,734
UPI PIN or card details.

11
00:00:16,734 --> 00:00:19,500
You never need a PIN to receive money.

12
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:20,449
Also,

13
00:00:20,449 --> 00:00:24,152
genuine employers do not ask for registration fees or

14
00:00:24,152 --> 00:00:26,108
security deposits for a job.

15
00:00:26,708 --> 00:00:27,483
And remember,

16
00:00:27,483 --> 00:00:29,390
if someone threatens you online,

17
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,046
do not pay.

18
00:00:30,046 --> 00:00:30,940
Save the chats,

19
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,847
block the account and report it.

20
00:00:32,847 --> 00:00:34,098
It is not your fault.

21
00:00:34,698 --> 00:00:38,449
The National Cyber Crime Helpline number is 1930.

22
00:00:39,049 --> 00:00:43,794
You can also report cybercrime online at cybercrime.gov.in.

